      "title": "Luxury Marble Bathroom",
      "description": "Marble bathroom ideas are one of the best ways to add luxury to your space. Marble is the most versatile and luxurious material that goes effortlessly with any interior décor.\n\nNo matter if you are looking for small bathroom ideas or large bathroom ideas, we have ways in which you can incorporate marble in your bathroom for luxurious and aesthetic bathroom décor.\n\nSince marble comes in a wide range of colors, textures, and patterns, they are a great material to add beauty to your bathroom. But since it is an expensive material, we can find some key areas to incorporate marble to elevate your bathroom look.\n\nHow Do You Use Marble in a Bathroom?\nWhether its utilizing marble as a bathroom counter slab, marble bathroom sink, or a marble bathtub, or simply adding marble bathroom accessories like marble soap dispensers, marble soap dish, marble vanity trays, etc, you can incorporate this versatile material in your bathroom in many ways.\n\nHere are some great cost-friendly ideas to add marble to your bathroom.\n\nMarble Flooring – You can choose from a range of different marble colors and textures to match with your interior from solid to veiny texture. You can go for bold colors like brown, black, and green marble as well as per your preferences.\nMarble Countertops- Bathroom countertops are one of the most important areas of the bathroom so it is very important to choose the right one. You can choose from white veiny marble countertops as they are evergreen and classic.\nMarble Bathroom Sink – You can choose to add unique marble handcrafted bathroom sinks that come in various designs like lotus marble bathroom sink, Ruffled marble bathroom sink, and Scallop bathroom sink. These bathroom sinks are trendy and unique. \nMarble bathroom sinks are the new trend and these wash basins are handcrafted one at a time hence each one is one of its own kind and gives a rustic but aesthetic look to your bathroom countertop.",
